OL,3,ARise in sales of radios and tinned
OL,4,Afoods, say retailers, after call to
OL,5,Astock up
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome retailers have seen a dramatic
OL,8,Fincrease in sales of essential goods
OL,9,Fafter the government called for people
OL,10,Fto stock up in case of a crisis,
OL,11,Faccording to figures obtained by
OL,12,FNewsnight.
OL,14,FThe Iceland supermarket chain said it
OL,15,Fwas "clear" consumers had listened to
OL,16,Fwarnings after it saw a 40% increase in
OL,17,Fsales of tinned products over the
OL,18,Fweekend.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
