OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARise in sales of radios and tinned
OL,4,Afoods, say retailers, after call to
OL,5,Astock up
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe rise in sales came after Defence
OL,8,FSecretary Wes Streeting said that
OL,9,Fpeople should stockpile goods to
OL,10,Fprepare for an emergency such as a
OL,11,Fcyber attack or an extreme weather
OL,12,Fevent.
OL,14,FRobert Dyas reported a 160% increase in
OL,15,Fsales of radios compared with last
OL,16,Fweek, while Maplin said sales had
OL,17,Fincreased by 92% in radios, 284% in
OL,18,Ftorches and 106% in power banks.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
